Privacy Policy
Last updated: November 25, 2026

This Privacy Policy describes how Dragon Games ("we", "us", or "our") collects,
uses, and protects the information you provide when using the Crystal Dragon mobile
application (the "Application" / "Game").

1. Information We Collect
The Application does not require an account and does not directly collect your
personal data (such as name, email address, or phone number). We do not collect
precise location data. However, we use third-party SDKs that may automatically
collect the following information:
- Advertising ID (AD_ID);
- IP address;
- Device type and operating system;
- Usage data (e.g., levels completed, score, time spent in the game, in-game actions).

2. How We Use Information
The collected information is used for:
- Displaying advertisements (both personalized and non-personalized);
- Analyzing application performance and improving gameplay via analytics services;
- Detecting and preventing technical issues.

3. Analytics
The Application uses analytics services to understand how players interact with the
Game and to improve gameplay and stability. These services may collect data about
your device and in-game behavior. Analytics data is used in aggregate or
pseudonymized form and is not used to identify you personally.

4. Third-Party Services
The Application uses third-party services that have their own Privacy Policies:
- Appodeal (ad mediation);
- Google Play Services;
- Analytics services.

5. Advertising and Opt-Out
The Application displays advertisements. You can opt out of personalized advertising
in your device settings (Settings -> Google -> Ads -> Opt out of Ads Personalization).
Uninstalling the Application stops all data collection.

6. Children's Privacy
The Application is intended for a general audience and is not directed to children
under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.
If you are a parent and believe your child has provided us with information, please
contact us.

7. Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The new version is effective
immediately upon posting on this page.

8. Contact Us
If you have any questions, please contact us at: ivandenisov422@gmail.com
